[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Pherb consumer daemon installed.

1. Copy and edit the configuration file:
   cp /usr/local/etc/pherb/settings.ini.sample /usr/local/etc/pherb/settings.ini

2. Enable and start the consumer:
   sysrc pherb_consumer_enable=YES
   service pherb_consumer start

3. Check consumer health:
   service pherb_consumer health

The consumer auto-creates the NATS JetStream stream and durable
consumer on first connect. Database migrations apply automatically.

See: https://docs.pacyworld.com/books/ai-speech-processing/chapter/pherb-orchestrator
EOM
}
